BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:itorrent-2.2.0@omnisource
DTSTAMP:20260719T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260719
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260720
SUMMARY:iTorrent v2.2.0
DESCRIPTION:iTorrent 2.2.0 | iTorrent\n\n## What's new:\n* Meet the new bui
 lt-in VLC player. Play compatible video and audio files directly in iTorre
 nt\, even while they are still downloading.\n* Enjoy Picture in Picture\, 
 playback speeds from 0.5x to 2x\, audio and subtitle track selection\, pre
 cise seeking\, and system media controls.\n* Take playback to a bigger scr
 een with AirPlay or a compatible player discovered on your local network.\
 n* Choose how pieces are downloaded with Sequential and First & Last prior
 ity modes\, making it easier to start watching sooner.\n* Select and share
  multiple completed files or entire folders in one go.\n\n## Improvements:
 \n* Refreshed the interface for iOS 26\, with Liquid Glass styling\, clean
 er dialogs\, and more polished navigation.\n* Made torrent details smoothe
 r and easier to use\, with clearer download-priority controls and private-
 torrent information.\n* Improved media previewing so iTorrent can offer th
 e best available player for each file.\n* Updated the torrent and media en
 gines for better compatibility\, stability\, and recovery from unexpected 
 errors.\n* Expanded and refined translations across all supported language
 s.\n\n## Fixes:\n* Fixed cases where magnet links could be saved incorrect
 ly.\n* Fixed a startup race condition that could interfere with launching 
 the app or completing initial setup.\n* Fixed toolbars and navigation beha
 ving incorrectly in iPad split-screen mode.\n* Fixed RSS downloads returni
 ng to the wrong screen.\n* Fixed torrent details sometimes getting stuck i
 n a continuous update loop.\n* Fixed several playback\, AirPlay\, and loca
 l-device connection issues.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/XITR
 IX/iTorrent/compare/v2.1.1-1...v2.2.0-1
URL:https://raynmahbub.github.io/OmniSource/feeds/itorrent.json
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:livecontainer-3.8.0@omnisource
DTSTAMP:20260717T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260717
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260718
SUMMARY:LiveContainer v3.8.0
DESCRIPTION:LiveContainer 3.8.0 | LiveContainer\n\n# LiveContainer 3.8.0\n\
 n> [!Warning]\n> The standalone version requires **SideStore 0.6.2+** or *
 *AltStore 2.2.1+** for installation.\n> To install LiveContainer with buil
 t-in SideStore (`LiveContainer+SideStore.ipa`)\, please use [Impactor](htt
 ps://github.com/khcrysalis/Impactor) or [iloader](https://github.com/nab13
 8/iloader). See [our installation guide](https://livecontainer.github.io/d
 ocs/installation/lc_sidestore) for details.\n\n# New Features\n\n## Storag
 e Management\n\n- Added a new storage management view with a breakdown of 
 app bundles\, containers\, temporary files\, app group data\, tweaks\, and
  other files. (Hidden apps' size is included in "other" section until unlo
 cked)\n- Added per-app storage details\, including app bundle size\, conta
 iner sizes\, and last-used date.\n- Added actions to clean temporary files
  and caches\, including guest app caches and LiveContainer's own caches.\n
 \n## Multiple LiveContainers\n- Added configurable launch priority for mul
 tiple LiveContainer instances\, making shared-app shortcuts choose availab
 le instances in the order you prefer. (#1367)\n\n## Share to Apps in LiveC
 ontainer\nAdded a share extension to LiveContainer. When you share a URL o
 r a file from iOS's share sheet\, LiveContainer will ask which app you wou
 ld like to open the URL/file in\, so the old share to LiveContainer shortc
 ut method is no longer needed. When an ipa file is shared in this way\, Li
 veContainer will ask if you want to install it in LiveContainer or in the 
 built-in SideStore (if installed) (#1357)\n\n## Multitasking\n\n- Added pe
 r-app multitask preferences. Each app can now follow the global setting\, 
 always launch in multitask mode\, or avoid multitask mode. (#1208)\n- Impr
 oved multitask dock behavior: the dock can be made smaller\, hidden more c
 leanly\, and has improved padding. (#1228\, #1250)\n- Added more multitask
  window animations and improved native-window scene handling.\n- URL schem
 es and `open-url` payloads can be passed to already-running
URL:https://raynmahbub.github.io/OmniSource/feeds/livecontainer.json
END:VEVENT
