 mpactor](https://github.com/claration/Impactor?tab=readme-ov-file#pairing-
 file) for easily retrieving a pairing file for installing!\n\n## What's Ch
 anged\n* Added tweak options in default signing options.\n* Added ability 
 to search for identifier's in Library @ismailcarlik in https://github.com/
 claration/Feather/pull/652\n* Fixed issue in the file enumeration logic\, 
 by using the path property instead of method.\n* Fixed credit links.\n* Fi
 xed duplicate repository in recommended repositories.\n\n## New Contributo
 rs\n* @xiangfeidexiaohuo made their first contribution in https://github.c
 om/claration/Feather/pull/634\n* @osageling made their first contribution 
 in https://github.com/claration/Feather/pull/642\n\n**Full Changelog**: ht
 tps://github.com/claration/Feather/compare/v2.8.2...v2.9.0
